# DevMotivate – Gamified Coding Productivity Extension 🚀

DevMotivate is a gamified VS Code extension designed to boost developer productivity using motivation, humor, and progression.

It transforms coding into an engaging experience by rewarding users with XP, ranks, and smart feedback.

## Features

* Earn XP automatically while coding
* Rank progression system (Bronze → Legend)
* Motivational quotes on saving files
* Funny roast messages when idle
* Live status bar showing XP and rank

## Why this project?

This extension helps developers stay consistent, focused, and entertained while working. Instead of coding feeling repetitive, DevMotivate turns it into a fun and rewarding experience.

## Tech Stack

* TypeScript
* VS Code Extension API

Built with a strong focus on user engagement, habit-building, and productivity enhancement.

## Vision

To make coding not just productive, but enjoyable — combining discipline with motivation and humor.
